@@ -3,3 +3,18 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) returns an in-memory rental service:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })` registers a `'board'` or `'sail'`; `dailyPrice` is an integer
+  number of euro cents per day.
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` returns `{ itemId, start, end, total }`.
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` books the item and returns `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`.
+
+Periods are UTC ISO-8601 strings at midnight; `end` is the start of the day after the last rental day, so
+`2026-07-01T00:00:00Z` to `2026-07-04T00:00:00Z` is three days. `quote` and `book` throw for an unknown
+item or a period that is not whole days; `book` also throws when the item is already booked for any part
+of the period. Cancellation (no refund under 24 hours before the start, full refund otherwise) is not
+implemented yet.
